[Intro]

[00:02.713 --> 00:06.144] Deema says, “Hummy yummy,”
[00:05.824 --> 00:09.973] “I feel something in my tummy!”

[Verse 1]

[00:09.654 --> 00:12.846] Deema’s tummy goes rumble, rumble,
[00:12.606 --> 00:16.037] Like a little hungry drum.
[00:15.638 --> 00:18.910] She wants something tasty, tasty,
[00:18.670 --> 00:22.101] “Can I please have some?”

[Chorus]

[00:21.782 --> 00:25.133] Hummy yummy in my tummy,
[00:24.814 --> 00:28.165] Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!
[00:27.846 --> 00:31.037] Deema’s hungry, time to eat,
[00:30.798 --> 00:33.112] Give her something good and sweet!

[00:32.952 --> 00:34.947] Hummy yummy in my tummy,
[00:34.548 --> 00:40.372] Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!
[00:39.973 --> 00:43.085] Clap your hands and tap your feet,
[00:43.005 --> 00:46.277] Deema says, “It’s time to eat!”

[Verse 2]

[00:46.037 --> 00:49.229] Apples, bananas, berries too,
[00:49.069 --> 00:52.500] Carrots make her crunch and chew.
[00:52.101 --> 00:55.851] Cheese and toast or rice and peas,
[00:55.133 --> 00:58.564] “Something yummy for me, please!”

[Chorus]

[00:58.165 --> 01:01.596] Hummy yummy in my tummy,
[01:01.197 --> 01:04.388] Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!
[01:04.309 --> 01:06.622] Deema’s hungry, time to eat,
[01:06.543 --> 01:10.771] Give her something good and sweet!

[01:10.372 --> 01:13.803] Hummy yummy in my tummy,
[01:13.404 --> 01:16.835] Hummy yummy, feed me, Mummy!
[01:16.436 --> 01:19.707] Clap your hands and tap your feet,
[01:19.468 --> 01:22.819] Deema says, “It’s time to eat!”

[Bridge]

[01:22.500 --> 01:25.931] Mix it, stir it, one, two, three,
[01:25.532 --> 01:28.803] Make a yummy plate for Deema.
[01:28.564 --> 01:31.915] Nibble, giggle, chew, chew, chew,
[01:31.596 --> 01:33.910] Deema shares her snack with you!

[Final Chorus]

[01:33.750 --> 01:35.665] Hummy yummy in my tummy,
[01:35.266 --> 01:41.489] Now Deema’s tummy feels so happy!
[01:40.771 --> 01:44.122] Something healthy, something neat,
[01:43.803 --> 01:47.154] Thank you for my yummy treat!

[01:46.835 --> 01:50.027] Hummy yummy in my tummy,
[01:49.787 --> 01:53.298] No more rumbling in my tummy!
[01:52.899 --> 01:56.011] Clap your hands and sing with Deema,
[01:55.931 --> 01:59.282] Yummy, yummy—one, two, three!

[Outro]

[01:58.963 --> 02:02.633] Deema says, “Hummy yummy,”
[02:01.995 --> 02:04.947] “Happy food inside my tummy!”
